# Block tab

The Block tab is the same on every new block. Do not invent extra Block settings.

Include only these settings, in this order, with no extra helper text:

1. Animation (section title “Animation”; Behavior uses the Figma outlined Text field plus the Hover Animation Dropdown)
2. Full-width divider
3. Padding (Figma segmented chips: — S M L + tune)

Do not add field-help or hint copy under Animation or Padding.
Do not include Link Container, Content Max Width, Content Layout, alignment, container size, Positioning, or Layer Position.
